  {
   "index": 16,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 297,
   "text": "Growing up, she understood how much representation matters. As an Indigenous girl, she rarely saw people who looked like her on television - with Olympic gold medallist Cathy Freeman one of the few visible role models. That absence shaped how she saw the game and what might be possible within it.",
